  "display_title": "The Time of Mr. and Mrs.",
  "description": "Ja-Ye was sold as a fake wife for Jeong Seon-Woo and became a talisman to ward off evil. The two lived as a show window couple for three years, realizing their feelings for each other, and their love deepens day by day… However, what stands in the way of their love is not the fact that Ja-Ye is a talisman to ward off evil, but the twisted maternal love of her mother-in-law, Ok-Hyun. In the end, the two make an irreversible decision to protect each other…\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
